WEBVTT

00:00:11.929 --> 00:00:12.429
"Minafes"

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:13.805
"Minafes"
Welcome to Minafes!

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:15.933
"Opens today!!"
Welcome to Minafes!

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:20.812
Enjoy the Appllio special buffet
as you wait for the show to start!

00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:26.485
The main dish is coming too slowly!

00:00:26.485 --> 00:00:29.738
The drink team should help the buffet team!

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:30.989
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:34.159
The dessert team is done with the preparations!

00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:35.994
Get to work immediately!

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:40.624
Anyone who spills <i>cream </i>will
get a <i>scream </i>of a punishment later.

00:00:40.624 --> 00:00:42.584
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:44.336
Wow...

00:00:44.336 --> 00:00:46.505
Amazing...

00:00:46.505 --> 00:00:49.633
Oh? It's a huge success...

00:00:51.218 --> 00:00:56.223
You're the one who made me
realize what true love was, servant!

00:00:56.223 --> 00:00:58.058
Prince!

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:04.231
Large breasts are merely lumps of fat.
Small breasts are true beauty.

00:01:04.231 --> 00:01:08.694
No, small breasts put the "re" in "refined"!

00:01:08.694 --> 00:01:10.821
That is what I love!

00:01:10.821 --> 00:01:15.742
My prince, I will also abandon my fake self.

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:18.745
Please look at my true appearance!

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:22.583
This should be okay, I think.

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:24.209
Oh, please wait.

00:01:24.209 --> 00:01:27.171
This line never seems to go smoothly...

00:01:27.171 --> 00:01:28.463
Kana!

00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:30.841
Stop being so wishy-washy!

00:01:30.841 --> 00:01:33.927
Now that we've come this far,
all that's left is to push through to the end!

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:40.642
Yeah, let's prove to the student council
that even we can do this much.

00:01:44.271 --> 00:01:47.274
We'll definitely make Minafes a success.

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:52.154
Let's do it!

00:01:52.154 --> 00:01:53.280
With all we have.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:55.574
We're the best!

00:01:55.574 --> 00:01:57.826
We'll show them!

00:01:58.827 --> 00:02:05.334
Ha... Happy Project... Fight!

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:08.253
Yeah!

00:02:14.384 --> 00:02:17.095
And now, for the moment
you've all been waiting for...

00:02:17.095 --> 00:02:18.972
Sponsored by the Happy Project,

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:23.560
it's the project where everyone
can have fun in Minazuki, Minafes!

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:27.314
Let's get started!

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:40.410
"Episode 12:
A Good Librarian Like a Good Shepherd"

00:02:46.708 --> 00:02:49.711
Our audience has been completely taken away...

00:02:49.711 --> 00:02:51.505
...by Minafes.

00:02:53.966 --> 00:02:59.137
It's unfortunate that there were so
few students who understood our ideals.

00:03:00.222 --> 00:03:01.348
Aoi...

00:03:01.348 --> 00:03:03.016
Please accept my apologies.

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:07.104
I will make sure not to
show you failure like this again.

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:14.778
Next, we have a miraculous collaboration between
the Comedic Storytelling Research Committee

00:03:14.778 --> 00:03:17.072
and the Stone Wall Research Committee!

00:03:20.492 --> 00:03:23.328
Yamada, bring a layer
of the turtle-shell pattern.

00:03:23.328 --> 00:03:25.163
Yes, sir!

00:03:25.163 --> 00:03:27.416
Those are unshaped stones, Yamada.

00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:29.168
Kanasuke, what are you looking at?

00:03:30.377 --> 00:03:33.213
Come here, please. Over here.

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:38.510
Look at that. Everyone looks
like they're having so much fun.

00:03:39.636 --> 00:03:43.015
I'm really glad we were
able to make it this far...

00:03:43.015 --> 00:03:48.270
My script, and getting recognized...
Those don't seem to matter anymore.

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:51.481
It's enough that everyone's laughing.

00:03:53.108 --> 00:03:54.860
Kanasuke...

00:03:56.612 --> 00:03:57.905
What are you two doing?

00:03:57.905 --> 00:04:02.159
Oh, this is just... Um...

00:04:02.159 --> 00:04:06.830
Hey, Kakei. After today's performance
is over, please give me a reward.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.874
A-A reward...?

00:04:08.874 --> 00:04:11.877
Isn't it obvious?

00:04:11.877 --> 00:04:16.757
Then, then, I want a reward, too!

00:04:19.801 --> 00:04:21.553
This is no time to be playing around!

00:04:21.553 --> 00:04:23.222
Suzuki, you need to get ready for the play!

00:04:23.222 --> 00:04:24.973
Misono, go warm up!

00:04:24.973 --> 00:04:27.267
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:29.937
Jeez... Inexcusable...

00:04:29.937 --> 00:04:32.064
S-Sorry...

00:04:34.441 --> 00:04:43.158
I think... you deserve a reward
for leading us all this far...

00:04:43.158 --> 00:04:45.452
Sakuraba?

00:04:45.452 --> 00:04:50.582
Wh-What would make you happy, I wonder...?

00:04:50.582 --> 00:04:53.418
Stare...

00:04:54.127 --> 00:04:56.505
Wh-What are you looking at?

00:04:56.505 --> 00:04:58.590
Go away!

00:05:00.509 --> 00:05:02.135
Idiot...

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:08.934
"Collaboration:
Traditional Swimming Methods &amp; ..."

00:05:09.434 --> 00:05:14.022
The Antique Music Box Club
looks like they will be late.

00:05:14.022 --> 00:05:18.402
Then I'll talk a little to fill in the time.
Would about five minutes be enough?

00:05:18.402 --> 00:05:20.821
Yes, thank you.

00:05:21.697 --> 00:05:24.408
Congratulations on the huge success.

00:05:24.408 --> 00:05:27.703
It's thanks to you helping us out, Serizawa.

00:05:27.703 --> 00:05:29.413
No need to thank me.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:37.129
Kakei, we were able to
make it this far together...

00:05:37.129 --> 00:05:39.882
Even so... why...?

00:05:40.465 --> 00:05:41.675
Hm?

00:05:41.675 --> 00:05:44.595
Oh my, they might have gotten bigger...

00:05:44.595 --> 00:05:46.305
Kana, you've been eating too much meat.

00:05:52.519 --> 00:05:53.979
You're all set, Tamamo.

00:05:53.979 --> 00:05:55.314
Thanks.

00:05:55.314 --> 00:06:02.863
Oh right, tell Kakei to start getting ready.
I told Takamine earlier already.

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:07.826
Okay, I'll go find Kakei.

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:21.465
Stop right there!

00:06:35.395 --> 00:06:38.315
I'm sure you were
thinking of getting in the way,

00:06:38.315 --> 00:06:41.652
but do you understand
what result that will bring?

00:06:41.652 --> 00:06:44.112
Stop! Let go of me!

00:06:44.112 --> 00:06:47.366
Why... I can't...!

00:06:47.366 --> 00:06:49.326
You'll end up a murderer!

00:06:59.253 --> 00:07:01.964
I have no idea what you're talking about!

00:07:01.964 --> 00:07:03.340
Kakei!

00:07:08.804 --> 00:07:10.556
I have no choice...

00:07:36.915 --> 00:07:42.004
I...! All I want is to lead
Shiomi Academy to the best future!

00:07:42.004 --> 00:07:46.383
If we let people with no abilities get in the way,
the whole school will just be ruined.

00:07:46.383 --> 00:07:48.135
That's why I'll eliminate them!

00:07:48.135 --> 00:07:49.845
What's wrong with that?

00:07:49.845 --> 00:07:51.930
You're the one that should disappear!

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:57.060
Why does Mochizuki like someone like you?!

00:07:58.937 --> 00:08:00.939
"Symposium Thinking About
the Future of Shiomi Academy"

00:08:00.939 --> 00:08:02.858
"Sponsored by the Shiomi Academy Student Council"

00:08:05.652 --> 00:08:07.529
"Symposium Thinking About
the Future of Shiomi Academy"

00:08:16.205 --> 00:08:17.581
Aoi.

00:08:17.581 --> 00:08:20.959
M-Mochizuki...

00:08:20.959 --> 00:08:24.755
Is that something a representative
of the students should say?

00:08:24.755 --> 00:08:29.843
I... I wanted to make Shiomi Academy
into the ideal school...

00:08:29.843 --> 00:08:35.307
To create the ideal environment where
those who excel can make a difference...

00:08:36.934 --> 00:08:42.314
No matter how lofty the goal, if the means
used to do it is wrong, no one will understand...

00:08:42.314 --> 00:08:45.484
That's not an ideal,
it's just self-justification.

00:08:45.484 --> 00:08:48.820
I watched you for a long time
without saying anything.

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:50.906
I thought you would probably fail...

00:08:51.949 --> 00:08:55.035
I knew that, but I didn't stop you...

00:08:55.994 --> 00:09:02.167
Because I thought that surely you would
realize what you were lacking yourself.

00:09:04.086 --> 00:09:06.922
Mochizuki...

00:09:07.256 --> 00:09:11.969
Sorry. I had to do this in order to stop you...

00:09:11.969 --> 00:09:18.392
I see. The Shepherd was
planning for you to lose.

00:09:18.976 --> 00:09:24.648
Not just to win, but to learn
from the battle itself... I see...

00:09:24.648 --> 00:09:27.860
That's why the boss said that to me...

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:30.863
That does sound like Nanai.

00:09:31.822 --> 00:09:34.867
You two are Shepherds?

00:09:34.867 --> 00:09:37.953
Well, yes...

00:09:37.953 --> 00:09:40.205
You'll give me an explanation later, right?

00:09:40.205 --> 00:09:42.291
Yes, of course.

00:09:44.543 --> 00:09:47.171
Aoi.

00:09:47.171 --> 00:09:54.386
Because of what happened with the lights,
we will take a break, investigate, and clean up

00:09:54.386 --> 00:09:56.889
before we continue the symposium.

00:09:58.015 --> 00:10:04.730
If Kakei hadn't become a Shepherd...
The falling light would've hit me...

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:09.026
Minafes, and everything...
it would've all been over.

00:10:12.321 --> 00:10:13.822
Kakei...

00:10:20.245 --> 00:10:24.416
Next, we have a collaboration
between the Tsugaru Shamisen Club

00:10:24.416 --> 00:10:27.836
and the Light Music Committee!

00:10:27.836 --> 00:10:28.420
"Collaboration: Tsugaru Shamisen Club
&amp; Light Music Committee"

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:31.757
"Shiomi Academy General Library"

00:10:32.382 --> 00:10:35.010
What is going on?

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:42.559
Shepherds are supposed to work in
the shadows of history to help people,

00:10:42.559 --> 00:10:49.066
but you two have dared to expose
that power in front of many people.

00:10:49.066 --> 00:10:54.905
There was no other way to completely
change the future to save Shirasaki.

00:10:54.905 --> 00:10:56.990
This was your idea?

00:10:56.990 --> 00:11:00.744
Yes, the responsibility is all mine.

00:11:00.744 --> 00:11:03.622
I was the one who got Kodachi involved.

00:11:03.622 --> 00:11:05.582
Kakei--

00:11:05.582 --> 00:11:11.213
I... I wanted to make everyone happy,
so I became a Shepherd.

00:11:11.213 --> 00:11:15.884
And I chose what I thought was best to that end.

00:11:15.884 --> 00:11:20.722
That is the path of the
Shepherd that I believe in.

00:11:25.519 --> 00:11:29.273
Boss, I feel the same way as Kakei.

00:11:29.273 --> 00:11:31.108
Kodachi!

00:11:31.108 --> 00:11:36.989
It's true that what Kakei did
might have been wrong as a Shepherd.

00:11:36.989 --> 00:11:41.660
But... I couldn't let it go, either.

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:43.829
He wanted to save her...

00:11:43.829 --> 00:11:47.541
He wanted to help everyone so
much that he became a Shepherd...

00:11:47.541 --> 00:11:49.918
I couldn't leave him...

00:11:54.339 --> 00:11:56.508
It can't be helped.

00:11:56.508 --> 00:12:01.471
In that case, I'll have to
make Kodachi a Shepherd, too.

00:12:02.848 --> 00:12:07.477
If I don't, I won't be able to erase both of you

00:12:07.477 --> 00:12:10.772
from the memories of all those
people gathered at the event all at once.

00:12:12.482 --> 00:12:18.864
I-I thought our qualifications
would be completely revoked.

00:12:18.864 --> 00:12:24.536
Why? There's no reason to take
away the qualifications of a Shepherd

00:12:24.536 --> 00:12:27.414
who has finally decided to make people happy.

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:31.251
What you were lacking this whole time...

00:12:31.251 --> 00:12:35.172
You have it now, don't you?

00:12:45.057 --> 00:12:49.686
Kakei, I understand your feelings.

00:12:49.686 --> 00:12:54.608
However, we have our own rules.

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:59.196
I don't plan on changing how I think.

00:12:59.196 --> 00:13:03.367
Then you are not qualified to be a Shepherd.

00:13:05.536 --> 00:13:07.663
I see.

00:13:07.663 --> 00:13:10.082
Your book doesn't exist anymore.

00:13:10.082 --> 00:13:17.214
If you do not become a Shepherd, you will
simply become an existence people forget.

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:25.347
I have... no regrets.

00:13:27.516 --> 00:13:30.185
Kakei still isn't back yet?

00:13:30.185 --> 00:13:32.271
The curtain is about to go up!

00:13:32.271 --> 00:13:37.734
It can't be helped. Takamine!
You have to perform in Kakei's place!

00:13:42.614 --> 00:13:47.995
You're the one who made me
realize what true love was, servant!

00:13:47.995 --> 00:13:49.705
Prince!

00:13:49.705 --> 00:13:57.296
Large breasts are merely
lumps of fat. But I love them!

00:13:57.296 --> 00:13:59.006
What?!

00:14:00.007 --> 00:14:05.429
If you still feel devoted to this school,

00:14:05.429 --> 00:14:08.056
then watch closely until the end...

00:14:10.267 --> 00:14:14.313
The exciting Minafes is now coming
to an end with its last performance...

00:14:14.313 --> 00:14:15.189
Where's Kakei?

00:14:15.189 --> 00:14:16.565
--How has it been so far, everyone?

00:14:16.565 --> 00:14:18.817
--Where did that guy go?
--How has it been so far, everyone?

00:14:18.817 --> 00:14:20.360
--It's finally time
--Now, before the final performance,

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:22.112
--for Shirasaki and Misono's big moment, too.
--Now, before the final performance,

00:14:22.112 --> 00:14:25.407
--we will have a few words from the sponsor.

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:30.162
Kakei... Thank you...

00:14:30.162 --> 00:14:33.832
Sorry for saying "I hate you"...

00:14:34.958 --> 00:14:38.462
The Minafes that you protected...

00:14:38.462 --> 00:14:40.964
I will see it through to the end.

00:14:42.758 --> 00:14:49.139
Please, give Kakei back to us...

00:14:50.474 --> 00:14:53.310
Well then, let's have her come on stage!

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:55.187
The person who put this all together--

00:14:55.187 --> 00:14:59.233
Representing the Happy Project,
it's Tsugumi Shirasaki!

00:15:20.838 --> 00:15:30.597
E-Everyone, th-thank you for coming to-today...

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:36.311
--Shirasaki, fight!
--Fight!

00:15:36.311 --> 00:15:38.021
You can do it!

00:15:38.021 --> 00:15:40.023
Thanks for Minafes!

00:15:40.023 --> 00:15:42.734
I was rooting for you from the start!

00:15:45.237 --> 00:15:49.283
Th-Thank you very much!

00:15:49.283 --> 00:15:55.539
Like she said, I'm Tsugumi Shirasaki
from the Happy Project...

00:15:57.207 --> 00:15:59.042
Um...

00:15:59.042 --> 00:16:01.545
With someone like me representing it,

00:16:01.545 --> 00:16:06.967
even though we call it a "project,"
we're just a small group with no power...

00:16:06.967 --> 00:16:09.553
"I want to make this school a happy place."

00:16:09.553 --> 00:16:12.055
I started acting with just that thought,

00:16:12.055 --> 00:16:15.893
but people who agreed with
me started gathering slowly,

00:16:15.893 --> 00:16:21.273
and finally, we were able
to put on a big event like this today.

00:16:21.273 --> 00:16:23.734
Even if you don't have any special power,

00:16:23.734 --> 00:16:28.739
if we all do our best together,
I'm sure we'll be able to change something.

00:16:28.739 --> 00:16:31.074
I'm sure we can change the future.

00:16:31.074 --> 00:16:36.371
That's what I thought this whole time. But...

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:44.254
But there were those who lent us their power.

00:16:44.254 --> 00:16:47.174
When we were about to fail on our own,

00:16:47.174 --> 00:16:51.428
they gave us a big push forward and saved us...

00:16:51.428 --> 00:16:56.934
Without that, Minafes would
not have happened today.

00:16:56.934 --> 00:17:03.357
I learned that I really am weak
and can't do anything...

00:17:03.357 --> 00:17:06.735
Huh? But it's strange...

00:17:06.735 --> 00:17:12.157
Why am I thinking that I'm weak
and can't do anything after all this...?

00:17:12.157 --> 00:17:13.784
That's not true!

00:17:13.784 --> 00:17:15.577
Th-Thank you.

00:17:15.577 --> 00:17:18.121
You can do it, Shirasaki!

00:17:18.121 --> 00:17:20.499
I'll do my best!

00:17:20.499 --> 00:17:26.547
I... We are just a group of weak people.

00:17:26.547 --> 00:17:33.428
We were even told that powerless people
like us don't need a place to do our activities...

00:17:33.428 --> 00:17:36.598
But we want you to watch...

00:17:36.598 --> 00:17:40.435
I think we can move forward.

00:17:40.435 --> 00:17:43.981
We'll get hurt... We'll have setbacks...

00:17:43.981 --> 00:17:47.943
We'll take the long way,
and take some breaks, too...

00:17:47.943 --> 00:17:49.570
But...

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:54.324
But even so, if we can do
something for someone else's sake...

00:17:54.324 --> 00:18:00.455
If each one of us can put our
strength together for someone else...

00:18:02.082 --> 00:18:05.836
Then I think we can move forward.

00:18:05.836 --> 00:18:08.338
The success of Minafes today

00:18:08.338 --> 00:18:13.260
was thanks to everyone lending their strength.

00:18:13.260 --> 00:18:14.845
Truly...

00:18:14.845 --> 00:18:17.431
I am truly grateful!

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:22.895
We want to move forward from here.

00:18:22.895 --> 00:18:24.897
It'll be a long road...

00:18:24.897 --> 00:18:30.027
It might be like walking
toward the starry night sky...

00:18:30.027 --> 00:18:35.574
But when those stars shine
on all our paths, one by one...

00:18:35.574 --> 00:18:37.701
When that time comes...

00:18:37.701 --> 00:18:40.495
Together...

00:18:41.872 --> 00:18:43.665
With Kakei...

00:18:45.375 --> 00:18:48.378
I hope that you'll...

00:18:48.378 --> 00:18:51.798
...walk together with us again.

00:18:51.798 --> 00:18:54.343
That's how I feel.

00:19:05.562 --> 00:19:08.649
And now, it's time for
today's final performance.

00:19:08.649 --> 00:19:10.234
The one you've all been waiting for--

00:19:10.234 --> 00:19:12.152
Senri Misono!

00:20:01.743 --> 00:20:03.203
Shirasaki.

00:20:06.832 --> 00:20:10.294
Good work. That was a nice speech.

00:20:11.587 --> 00:20:13.881
Kakei...

00:20:16.425 --> 00:20:21.054
Shirasaki, I... was fired as a Shepherd.

00:20:21.054 --> 00:20:23.015
What?

00:20:23.015 --> 00:20:26.685
I wasn't cut out for the job, after all.

00:20:26.685 --> 00:20:31.064
But my book doesn't exist anymore...

00:20:31.064 --> 00:20:34.026
So one day, you guys will...

00:20:34.026 --> 00:20:35.569
I won't forget you!

00:20:35.569 --> 00:20:38.405
It doesn't matter what happened to the book.

00:20:39.156 --> 00:20:44.119
No matter what happens,
I won't forget you, Kakei.

00:20:44.119 --> 00:20:47.414
There's no way I'd forget you!

00:21:00.469 --> 00:21:02.679
Together forever.

00:21:02.679 --> 00:21:08.185
You should go forward with us, too...

00:21:09.311 --> 00:21:10.938
I will.

00:21:20.781 --> 00:21:24.993
I wonder where he got that stubbornness from...

00:21:26.411 --> 00:21:31.291
I wonder if this will
atone for my sin a little...

00:21:38.173 --> 00:21:42.052
"Minafes is a huge success!"

00:21:43.303 --> 00:21:46.682
I deeply apologize for my actions!

00:21:47.266 --> 00:21:48.725
Oh! That's...

00:21:48.725 --> 00:21:53.397
Aoi, will you give me the file for this picture?

00:21:53.397 --> 00:21:55.691
That's...

00:21:55.691 --> 00:21:59.486
I looked into it, and I found
out they're called "Shepherds."

00:21:59.486 --> 00:22:04.074
Right, right. They use magic
to help everyone, right?

00:22:04.074 --> 00:22:07.786
I wish I can be like that, too...

00:22:20.048 --> 00:22:24.344
It's gotta be that.
No, no, I'm sure of it! I am!

00:22:32.269 --> 00:22:34.855
Hey, watch your step.

00:22:39.985 --> 00:22:43.655
Oh, welcome home.

00:22:44.156 --> 00:22:46.450
Koda... Wh-Why...?

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:50.787
Do you want a bath? Do you want dinner?

00:22:50.787 --> 00:22:55.167
Or...

00:22:56.210 --> 00:22:58.545
You! What about being a Shepherd?

00:22:58.545 --> 00:23:06.178
Oh that? I became the Shepherd
in charge of Shiomi Academy.

00:23:06.178 --> 00:23:07.596
What?!

00:23:09.181 --> 00:23:13.852
Kakei, I came to make dinner!

00:23:13.894 --> 00:23:15.687
Kakei!

00:23:19.358 --> 00:23:22.236
Kakei!

00:23:22.236 --> 00:23:23.362
Kakei?

00:23:23.362 --> 00:23:25.864
You're so popular, Big Brother.

00:23:25.864 --> 00:23:29.201
Shall we make a scene?

00:23:30.285 --> 00:23:33.038
Stop it...!

00:23:39.086 --> 00:23:47.678
"Let's work hard on Minafes!"
"Kyoko"
